         measured: V2: ~-1.5 (the theory's value), with the measured median sitting on the registered -...; V3: D2 NOT TRIGGERED, undecided NFW-vs-theory at this window, resolves below ~0.1 R500
         reading : the D2 kill condition ('inner slope consistent with -1 and inconsistent with -1.5') is NOT met: the data are inconsistent with -1 and consistent with -1.5

